 to split H2. All machinery would be powered by Hydroelectric power. H2O source would come from same source as hydroelectric power reservoir. H2 would be extracted from same water source. This is a closed system which produces tritium without phage virus contamination, pycnogonida, or spider crabs.","topics":[],"score":175362,"global_rank":428618},{"name":"nielsjsc/CONIKS_paper","owner":"nielsjsc","html_url":"https://github.com/nielsjsc/CONIKS_paper","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":175362,"global_rank":428619},{"name":"fiquett/RaspberryPi-Flipper-Repeater-Interface","owner":"fiquett","html_url":"https://github.com/fiquett/RaspberryPi-Flipper-Repeater-Interface","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"This repository hosts the source code and documentation for an innovative project that integrates a Raspberry Pi with a Flipper device to interface with radio repeaters. ","topics":[],"score":175362,"global_rank":428620},{"name":"julianallenderussek/database_example_two","owner":"julianallenderussek","html_url":"https://github.com/julianallenderussek/database_example_two","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":175362,"global_rank":428621},{"name":"julianallenderussek/database_example","owner":"julianallenderussek","html_url":"https://github.com/julianallenderussek/database_example","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":175362,"global_rank":428622},{"name":"planetcohen/music-website","owner":"planetcohen","html_url":"https://github.com/planetcohen/music-website","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Website for artist alison cohen","topics":[],"score":175357,"global_rank":428623},{"name":"louiesch/Library.Solution","owner":"louiesch","html_url":"https://github.com/louiesch/Library.Solution","stars":0,